  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific agreement HI Fact Finding mission Mosambik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned main product of the Activity is a joint fact-finding mission report which will provide the basis and insight into how best to move forward with the cooperation with Mozambique under the Oceans for Development programme. This Agreement also covers the participation of one expert from the Directorate of Fisheries in the fact finding mission, including time for preparations and reporting.The expected effect/s for the target group of the Activity is i.e. to promote a strengthened, sustainable, and inclusive ocean economy and to contribute to socio-economic development and to reduce poverty in Mozambique</narrative>
  </description>
